  "notes": "Standard Deduction Worksheet for Dependents, line 1: the number (0-4) of boxes checked for born before January 2, 1961 and blind, for the taxpayer and the spouse (i1040gi-2025, line 12e worksheet). Spouse boxes count only on a married filing jointly, married filing separately or qualifying surviving spouse return, as in rule.form1040-standard-deduction v2, so lines 3 plus 4b equal v2 for a non-dependent."
